{"data": [{"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:46:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115908251577368782"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - A Democratic victory in Congress could halt the Trump administration’s controversial grant-review plan and curb some of its funding actions.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4zZgcG5", "end": 223, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4zZgcG5", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115908255851376640/zwWqQDRE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115908255851376640/zwWqQDRE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 200, "status": 200, "title": "How the US mid-term elections could shake up science", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03479-0?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64272098&error=cookies_not_supported&code=fca86b98-6154-4a58-9d82-1154aceb121b", "url": "https://t.co/ac8MtD1kFc"}]}, "id": "2115908251577368782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1581, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "As voters head to the polls on 3 November for the US mid-term elections, a political shake-up could be coming to Washington DC — with substantial consequences for the country’s scientific landscape.\n\nhttps://t.co/ac8MtD1kFc", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2115908251577368782"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:32:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115904585265283369"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Abstract. Epidemiologic studies suggest that patients with pre-existing type 1 diabetes have a decreased risk of developing melanoma, prostate cancer, and", "display_url": "academic.oup.com/jimmunol/artic…", "end": 256, "expanded_url": "https://academic.oup.com/jimmunol/article/215/10/vkag262/9003854", "images": [{"height": 461, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.co