_count": 0}, "text": "Meet the four academics who dreamed up California’s billionaire tax on the ballot Tuesday as Prop. 40 https://t.co/co2oZbcsfF", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2115846241120587940"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:37:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115845497563083128"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Mutations accumulate in cells with age, while caloric restriction extends lifespan across diverse animals. Grońska-Pęski et al. study the effect of caloric restriction on mutations genome-wide in mice, finding reduced mutation burdens across several tissues and cell types, thereby establishing that diet can alter mutation accumulation genome-wide during aging.", "display_url": "cell.com/cell/abstract/…", "end": 241, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)00940-2", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115827089396080640/KY25As16?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115827089396080640/KY25As16?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 218, "status": 200, "title": "Caloric restriction modulates genome-wide somatic mutation in mice", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)00940-2", "url": "https://t.co/H7MQfq75Gk"}, {"description": "In this issue of Cell, Grońska-Pęski et al. examine how calorie restriction (CR) affects DNA mutation rates. While CR lowers the accumulation of mutations, this effect does not scale with the degree of lifespan extension. Their work raises important new questions about how CR impacts the causal mechanisms of aging.", "display_url": "cell.com/cell/abstract/…", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)01140-2", "images": [{"height": 438, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115845500884930560/zT64e35c?format=png&name=orig", "width": 876}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115845500884930560/zT64e35c?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 242, "status": 200, "title": "Calorie restriction uncouples mutation rate from lifespan", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)01140-2", "url": "https://t.co/YA2FzC7FQZ"}]}, "id": "2115845497563083128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 10010, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Caloric restriction (CR), in many species, extends lifespan. In a new study, CR reduced the accumulation of somatic mutations, but that was not enough to account for change in lifespan. Work in the experimental model.\nhttps://t.co/H7MQfq75Gk\nhttps://t.co/YA2FzC7FQZ", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2115845497563083128"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "15862891", "name": "nature", "username": "Nature"}, {"id": "86626845", "name": "Eric Topol", "username": "EricTopol"}, {"id": "32372834", "name": "Science Magazine", "username": "ScienceMagazine"}, {"id": "28164923", "name": "WSJ Markets", "username": "WSJmarkets"}, {"id": "860158302", "name": "Quanta Magazine", "username": "QuantaMagazine"}, {"id": "3290364847", "name": "STAT", "username": "statnews"}, {"id": "15134240", "name": "NIH", "username": "NIH"}, {"id": "407985006", "name": "Physics Magazine", "username": "PhysicsMagazine"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115908251577368782", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlxoaww8k9rxytb933efcsal87zx", "oldest_id": "2115845497563083128", "result_count": 25}}
